(a) Take-off power rating;
(b) Maximum continuous power rating;
(c) Maximum rated power rating;
(d) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration;
(e) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration at a specified altitude;
(f) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration at a specified altitude and a specified ambient temperature;
(g) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration at a specified altitude and a specified ambient temperature and a specified manifold pressure;
(h) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration at a specified altitude and a specified ambient temperature and a specified manifold pressure and a specified engine speed;
