(l) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration at a specified altitude and a specified ambient temperature and a specified manifold pressure and a specified engine speed and a specified fuel flow and a specified oil pressure and a specified oil temperature and a specified oil level;
(m) Maximum rated power rating for a specified duration at a specified altitude and a specified ambient temperature and a specified manifold pressure and a specified engine speed and a specified fuel flow and a specified oil pressure and a specified oil temperature and a specified oil level and a specified oil viscosity;
